.\n- `printLine`/`printIntLine`: produce identical lines, and the C `NULL` guard is mirrored by the `Option<&str>` match.\n- `argc`/`argv` are unused; passing extra args still matches.\n- Exit code 0 in all cases.\n\nNo code changes were needed — the translation already matches the C ground truth."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":423,"cache_read_input_tokens":19710,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":423,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":38,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f012636c-c0c2-435f-8823-03a5ca16a64d","uuid":"fe1db346-0afa-450c-8c05-c598b57deca9"}
